    "title": "Scotland Avenue Closed for Water Main Replacement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago The Connecticut Water Company is currently replacing the water main on Scotland Avenue and River Edge Farms Road. Work on Scotland Avenue is underway, and the road is closed during working hours (7:00AM – 5:00PM), though it remains accessible to local traffic, emergency vehicles, and buses. Work on River Edge Farms Road is expected to begin the week of March 30, 2026. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
